# ─── Claude Code setup (.claude/) ───────────────────────────────────
# The setup itself stays tracked and reviewed (see SETUP.md). Only
# per-machine files are ignored; settings.local.json is listed above.
.claude/settings.json.backup
.claude/settings.json.backup.*
.claude/settings.local.json.backup*

# Prisma's generated client: machine-written TypeScript, rebuilt by `pnpm generate`,
# which the build, typecheck and test tasks depend on.
apps/api/src/generated/

# ─── Roadmap: local planning only, never committed ──────────────────
# The ticket list and its prompts stay on the machine of whoever is
# planning. Keeping it out of git stops half-edited tickets landing in
# review diffs. CLAUDE.md records that it is local-only.
ROADMAP.md
docs/ROADMAP.md

# Playwright run output: traces, screenshots and the last-run marker. Regenerated by
# `pnpm e2e` and specific to one machine's run.
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.playwright/
